[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_03_0010","text":"…………呼……呼……！\n制作人大人……那、那个……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_03_0020","text":"哎哎，怎么了\n一结束就跑过来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_03_0030","text":"……那个────\n您觉得……怎么样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_03_0040","text":"哈哈，没问题的\n不用那么担心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_03_0050","text":"非常完美\n带着自信上台吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_03_0060","text":"好、好的……！\n……那个……还有……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_03_0070","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_03_0080","text":"————不……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_03_0090","text":"我会……竭尽全力……\n下一次……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200100_03_0100","text":"希望能听到您说……\n我很美……────"}]
